msgid "Allowed (GLPI default behavior)"
msgstr "Dibenarkan (tingkah laku lalai GLPI)"

msgid "Block solution approval when there is a comment"
msgstr "Sekat kelulusan penyelesaian apabila terdapat komen"

msgid "Comments during solution approval"
msgstr "Komen semasa kelulusan penyelesaian"

msgid "Configuration saved successfully."
msgstr "Konfigurasi berjaya disimpan."

msgid "Error saving configuration."
msgstr "Ralat semasa menyimpan konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"It is not allowed to enter comments when approving a solution. Please leave "
"the text box empty or refuse the solution."
msgstr ""
"Ia tidak dibenarkan untuk memasukkan komen semasa meluluskan penyelesaian. "
"Sila biarkan kotak teks kosong atau tolak penyelesaian."

msgid "Show warning to the user, allowing the solution approval"
msgstr "Tunjukkan amaran kepada pengguna, membenarkan kelulusan"

msgid "Solution Approval Guard"
msgstr "Pengawal Kelulusan Penyelesaian"

msgid "Solution Approval Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Kelulusan Penyelesaian"

msgid "Solution approved"
msgstr "Penyelesaian diluluskan"

msgid ""
"Warning: Your solution was approved, but to report pending issues you must "
"refuse the solution or open a new ticket."
msgstr ""
"Amaran: Penyelesaian anda telah diluluskan, tetapi untuk melaporkan isu yang"
" belum selesai anda mesti menolak penyelesaian atau membuka tiket baharu."

msgid "Approval with a comment is allowed immediately. A warning is displayed after submission to explain that pending issues should be reported by refusing the solution or opening a new ticket. No additional confirmation is requested and approval is not blocked."
msgstr "Kelulusan dengan ulasan dibenarkan serta-merta. Amaran dipaparkan selepas penyerahan untuk menjelaskan bahawa isu yang belum selesai harus dilaporkan dengan menolak penyelesaian atau membuka tiket baharu. Tiada pengesahan tambahan diminta dan kelulusan tidak disekat."

msgid "Approval is blocked on the server when the comment contains text. To approve, the user must clear the comment; if the problem persists, they should refuse the solution instead. Empty HTML tags and spaces alone are not considered a comment."
msgstr "Kelulusan disekat pada pelayan apabila ulasan mengandungi teks. Untuk meluluskan, pengguna mesti mengosongkan ulasan; jika masalah berterusan, mereka harus menolak penyelesaiannya. Teg dan ruang HTML kosong sahaja tidak dianggap sebagai ulasan."

msgid "When the user approves a solution with a comment, a confirmation dialog is displayed before submission. Approve anyway continues the approval with the comment. Cancel, Escape or closing the dialog keeps the comment without submitting the approval. If the problem persists, the user should cancel and refuse the solution instead. Empty comments do not require additional confirmation."
msgstr "Apabila pengguna meluluskan penyelesaian dengan ulasan, dialog pengesahan dipaparkan sebelum penyerahan. Luluskan juga meneruskan kelulusan dengan ulasan. Batal, Escape atau menutup dialog menyimpan ulasan tanpa menyerahkan kelulusan. Jika masalah berterusan, pengguna harus membatalkan dan menolak penyelesaian itu. Komen kosong tidak memerlukan pengesahan tambahan."
